<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Site en maintenance — ES Coutances</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #0D0D0D;
      color: #fff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .box { max-width: 480px; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #C8102E; }
    p { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.6; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>Site en maintenance</h1>
    <p>Le site de l'ES Coutances est momentanément indisponible. Merci de revenir un peu plus tard.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
